        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8056WM, Clawfoot Wembley Lever with Ornate Lancaster Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe unique shape of the Wembley Lever paired with the ornate Lancaster Rose brings to mind the medieval world. Positively dripping with antique beauty, this Emtek Hardware made lever and rose set is a perfect addition for anyone who wants to add the richness of the old world to their homes while still maintaining an omnipresence that allows it to span the chasms of ever-changing style trends. The Wembley Lever with Lancaster Rose will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions for this Clawfoot Leverset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Ornate Clawfoot Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Wembley Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-7-finish.jpg?v=1704354517\" width=\"600\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Wembley Lever with Lancaster Rose",
                "description": "The unique shape of the Wembley Lever paired with the ornate Lancaster Rose brings to mind the medieval world. Positively dripping with antique beauty, this Emtek Hardware made lever and rose set is a perfect addition for anyone who wants to add the richness of the old world to their homes while still maintaining an omnipresence that allows it to span the chasms of ever-changing style trends. The Wembley Lever with Lancaster Rose will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions for this Clawfoot Leverset.\r\n",
